# ICU collation rules: Deseret Alphabet, "Speller" order.
# Tailoring of the CLDR root collation.  Feed this string to
# icu::RuleBasedCollator (C++), com.ibm.icu.text.RuleBasedCollator (Java),
# or icu.RuleBasedCollator (PyICU).  Lines beginning with # are comments
# and must be stripped before use (see examples/).
#
# 1. Diphthongs AY, OI, OW, EW follow LONG OO (𐐅) and precede SHORT I (𐐆).
&𐐭<𐐴<<<𐐌<𐑎<<<𐐦<𐐵<<<𐐍<𐑏<<<𐐧
# 2. YEE, WU, H follow ENG (𐐥) at the end of the alphabet.
&𐑍<𐐷<<<𐐏<𐐶<<<𐐎<𐐸<<<𐐐
